  "corrections": [
    "Attribute graduation to OPA rather than treating Gatekeeper as a separately graduated project; remove unsupported performance rankings.",
    "Pin chart/Gator3.23.1; use actual auditInterval/logLevel fields, webhook failurePolicy and controller/audit replica behavior.",
    "Use input.review; distinguish supported legacy RegoV0 from explicit code.source.version v1.",
    "Provide complete required-label schema and nonempty-label policy.",
    "Cover regular/init/ephemeral containers for privilege/image checks without workload-controlled bypass labels.",
    "Replace fail-open quantity parsing with pinned upstream policy; test regular/init limits and skip invalid ephemeral resource fields.",
    "Require separator-terminated image prefixes and test registry/path spoofing.",
    "Fix Ingress self-exclusion so same-namespace/different-name and different-namespace/same-name conflicts are detected; explain cache/race/wildcard limits.",
    "Describe selected policies as partial checks rather than full Baseline/Restricted PSS.",
    "Use ModifySet to preserve unrelated tolerations and prove idempotence/scope natively.",
    "Distinguish auditInterval from Config.validation.traces debugging; avoid raw sensitive debugging data.",
    "Use real validation metric names/labels and PodMonitor on both actual Deployments rather than a nonexistent Service metrics port.",
    "Use gator verify Suites and gator test -f manifests; require expected test/case counts; pin binary and avoid untrusted CI cluster credentials.",
    "Distinguish dryrun/warn/deny output and exit behavior, with populated Constraint parameters.",
    "Correct quiz object-value versus object-key iteration, partial-set semantics, self-link and unsupported recursive-rule/bundle claims."
  ],
  "clarifications": [
    "Gatekeeperlegacytarget.rego defaultsV0, soV0notautomaticallyinvalid;newlocaltemplatesoptV1source.version",
    "Kyverno currentREADME stillstatesCNCFIncubating; OPAgraduatedstatusmustnotattributeastandaloneGatekeepergraduation",
    "Gatekeeper resourcequantities applynormal/init only; ephemeralcontainerscannotsetresources",
    "Gator officialSuitesupportsviolationsyes/noorinteger; useexactintegerassertions"
